<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">function</span><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;"> 函数名</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">()</span></span>
